{"ref":"BDB, רָכִיל","hw":"רָכִיל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָכִיל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>slander</strong>, > <strong>tale-bearer, informer</strong>;—always <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs.;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ יַהֲלֹךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.3\">Je 9:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּלֵךְ ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.16\">Lv 19:16</a> (H), <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹלֵךְ ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.13\">Pr 11:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.19\">20:19</a>, all of going about <em>in slander</em>, as slanderer (Ges<sup>§ 118 q</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הֹלְכֵי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.28\">Je 6:28</a> <em>goers of slander</em> (slanderous persons) (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, הָלַךְ\" href=\"/BDB,_הָלַךְ\", dir=\"rtl\">הָלַךְ</a>, p. 231 f.); <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.9\">Ez 22:9</a> <em>men of slander</em>, informers.","next":"BDB, מַרְכֹּ֫לֶת²","prev":"BDB, רָכָל"}